btrbak (1.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix btrfs filesystem UUID parsing for btrfs-progs >= 6.6, which prints
    the filesystem label and uuid on the same line; same-filesystem
    validation no longer fails with "dest must be on the same btrfs
    filesystem as src".

 -- Kaiden <11036039+KaidenP@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:18:44 -0400

btrbak (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Make retention count-based: `keep` is now a positive integer (the number
    of backups to retain, plus their parents), with `-1` meaning keep forever.
  * Run the apt and boot hooks with `--full` so each event captures a
    self-contained full snapshot.

 -- Kaiden <11036039+KaidenP@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 23:29:16 -0400

